<!-- rtdf-document-id: sara/section2 -->

> Module Section2
> Using Definitions as W
> Using Section7703 as S7703
> Using Section152 as S152

```catala-metadata
declaration enumeration FilingStatus:
  -- JointOrSurviving
  -- HeadOfHousehold
  -- Unmarried
  -- MarriedFilingSeparately

declaration scope SurvivingSpouse:
  input world content W.World
  input taxpayer content W.Entity
  input period content W.TaxPeriod
  marital scope S7703.MaritalStatusA
  dependents_scope scope S152.DependentsOf
  output holds content boolean

declaration scope HeadOfHousehold:
  input world content W.World
  input taxpayer content W.Entity
  input period content W.TaxPeriod
  marital scope S7703.MaritalStatusA
  dependents_scope scope S152.DependentsOf
  surviving_scope scope SurvivingSpouse
  output holds content boolean

declaration scope FilingStatusFor:
  input world content W.World
  input taxpayer content W.Entity
  input period content W.TaxPeriod
  marital scope S7703.MaritalStatusA
  surviving_scope scope SurvivingSpouse
  head_scope scope HeadOfHousehold
  output status content FilingStatus
  output spouse content optional of W.Entity
```

```catala
declaration value_references_entity content boolean
  depends on value content W.Value,
             entity content W.Entity
  equals match value with pattern
         -- W.Value.Known content known: false
         -- W.Value.Named content named: W.same_entity of named, entity

declaration home_costs content money
  depends on world content W.World,
             home content W.Entity,
             period content W.TaxPeriod
  equals Money.sum of
    (combine all payment among (W.financial_events_of_kind of world, W.EventKind.Payment)
     in amounts initially []
     with if W.overlaps_period of payment.starts, payment.ends, period
             and exists purpose among payment.purposes
                 such that value_references_entity of purpose, home
          then amounts ++ (W.weighted_amounts of payment) else amounts)

declaration home_costs_by content money
  depends on world content W.World,
             payer content W.Entity,
             home content W.Entity,
             period content W.TaxPeriod
  equals Money.sum of
    (combine all payment among (W.financial_events_of_kind of world, W.EventKind.Payment)
     in amounts initially []
     with if W.has_agent of payment, payer
             and W.overlaps_period of payment.starts, payment.ends, period
             and exists purpose among payment.purposes
                 such that value_references_entity of purpose, home
          then amounts ++ (W.weighted_amounts of payment) else amounts)

declaration maintains_household_of content boolean
  depends on world content W.World,
             taxpayer content W.Entity,
             individual content W.Entity,
             period content W.TaxPeriod
  equals exists residence among
           (W.relationship_events_of_kind of world, W.EventKind.Residence)
         such that W.has_agent of residence, individual
           and W.overlaps_period of residence.starts, residence.ends, period
           and exists home among residence.patients such that
             furnishes_over_half_home_cost of world, taxpayer, home, period
```

§2. Definitions and special rules

(a) Definition of surviving spouse

    (1) In general

    For purposes of section 1, the term "surviving spouse" means a taxpayer-


```catala
scope SurvivingSpouse:
  definition marital.world equals world
  definition marital.taxpayer equals taxpayer
  definition marital.period equals period
  definition dependents_scope.world equals world
  definition dependents_scope.taxpayer equals taxpayer
  definition dependents_scope.candidates equals W.dependency_candidates of world
  definition dependents_scope.period equals period
  definition holds equals
    not marital.result.married
    and exists spouse among marital.result.spouses such that
      spouse_died_in_prior_two_years of world, spouse, period
    and exists child among dependents_scope.dependents such that
      surviving_spouse_child_household of world, taxpayer, child, period
    and surviving_spouse_limitations_clear of world, taxpayer,
                                                marital.result.spouses, period
```

        (A) whose spouse died during either of the two years immediately preceding the taxable year, and


<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section2:b0004; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section2(a)(1)(A); source-lines: 9-9; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration spouse_died_in_prior_two_years content boolean
  depends on world content W.World,
             spouse content W.Entity,
             period content W.TaxPeriod
  equals exists death among (W.relationship_events_of_kind of world, W.EventKind.Death)
         such that W.has_agent of death, spouse
           and exists died among death.starts such that
             (Date.get_year of died) >= period.tax_year - 2
             and (Date.get_year of died) < period.tax_year
```

        (B) who maintains as his home a household which constitutes for the taxable year the principal place of abode (as a member of such household) of a dependent (i) who (within the meaning of section 152) is a son, stepson, daughter, or stepdaughter of the taxpayer, and (ii) with respect to whom the taxpayer is entitled to a deduction for the taxable year under section 151.


<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section2:b0005; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section2(a)(1)(B); source-lines: 11-11; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration surviving_spouse_child_household content boolean
  depends on world content W.World,
             taxpayer content W.Entity,
             child content W.Entity,
             period content W.TaxPeriod
  equals S152.child_or_descendant of world, child, taxpayer, period
         and S152.same_household of world, child, taxpayer, period
         and maintains_household_of of world, taxpayer, child, period
```

    For purposes of this paragraph, an individual shall be considered as maintaining a household only if over half of the cost of maintaining the household during the taxable year is furnished by such individual.


```catala
declaration furnishes_over_half_home_cost content boolean
  depends on world content W.World,
             taxpayer content W.Entity,
             home content W.Entity,
             period content W.TaxPeriod
  equals
    let paid equals home_costs_by of world, taxpayer, home, period in
    let total equals home_costs of world, home, period in
    paid > $0 and paid > total - paid
```

    (2) Limitations

    Notwithstanding paragraph (1), for purposes of section 1 a taxpayer shall not be considered to be a surviving spouse-


```catala
declaration surviving_spouse_limitations_clear content boolean
  depends on world content W.World,
             taxpayer content W.Entity,
             spouses content list of W.Entity,
             period content W.TaxPeriod
  equals
    not (remarried_before_year_end of world, taxpayer, period)
    and (joint_return_permitted of world, taxpayer, spouses, period)
```

        (A) if the taxpayer has remarried at any time before the close of the taxable year, or


<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section2:b0008; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section2(a)(2)(A); source-lines: 19-19; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration remarried_before_year_end content boolean
  depends on world content W.World,
             taxpayer content W.Entity,
             period content W.TaxPeriod
  equals
    let marriages equals
      list of marriage among (W.relationship_events_of_kind of world, W.EventKind.Marriage)
      such that W.has_agent of marriage, taxpayer
                and W.overlaps_period of marriage.starts, marriage.ends, period in
    let count equals
      combine all marriage among marriages in result initially 0
      with result + 1 in
    count > 1
```

        (B) unless, for the taxpayer's taxable year during which his spouse died, a joint return could have been made. A husband and wife may make a single return jointly of income taxes, even though one of the spouses has neither gross income nor deductions, except that no joint return shall be made if either the husband or wife at any time during the taxable year is a nonresident alien.


<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section2:b0009; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section2(a)(2)(B); source-lines: 21-21; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration joint_return_permitted content boolean
  depends on world content W.World,
             taxpayer content W.Entity,
             spouses content list of W.Entity,
             period content W.TaxPeriod
  equals
    not (nonresident_alien_during_year of world, taxpayer, period)
    and not (exists spouse among spouses such that
      nonresident_alien_during_year of world, spouse, period)
```

(b) Definition of head of household

    (1) In general

    An individual shall be considered a head of a household if, and only if, such individual is not married at the close of his taxable year, is not a surviving spouse (as defined in subsection (a)), and either-


```catala
scope HeadOfHousehold:
  definition marital.world equals world
  definition marital.taxpayer equals taxpayer
  definition marital.period equals period
  definition dependents_scope.world equals world
  definition dependents_scope.taxpayer equals taxpayer
  definition dependents_scope.candidates equals W.dependency_candidates of world
  definition dependents_scope.period equals period
  definition surviving_scope.world equals world
  definition surviving_scope.taxpayer equals taxpayer
  definition surviving_scope.period equals period
  definition holds equals
    (not marital.result.married
     or (output of S7703.TreatedAsUnmarried with {
           -- world: world -- taxpayer: taxpayer -- period: period
           -- deductible_children: dependents_scope.dependents }).holds)
    and not surviving_scope.holds
    and ((exists individual among dependents_scope.dependents such that
            shared_household_qualifier of world, taxpayer, individual, period)
         or (exists parent among dependents_scope.dependents such that
               parent_household_qualifier of world, taxpayer, parent, period))
    and head_of_household_limitations_clear of world, taxpayer, period, false
```

        (A) maintains as his home a household which constitutes for more than one-half of such taxable year the principal place of abode, as a member of such household, of-


```catala
declaration shared_household_qualifier content boolean
  depends on world content W.World,
             taxpayer content W.Entity,
             individual content W.Entity,
             period content W.TaxPeriod
  equals S152.family_relationship of world, individual, taxpayer, period
         and S152.same_household of world, individual, taxpayer, period
         and maintains_household_of of world, taxpayer, individual, period
```

            (i) a qualifying child of the individual (as defined in section 152(c)), but not if such child-


```catala
declaration qualifying_child_household_member content boolean
  depends on is_qualifying_child content boolean,
             shares_household content boolean
  equals is_qualifying_child and shares_household
```

                (I) is married at the close of the taxpayer's taxable year, and


<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section2:b0013; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section2(b)(1)(A)(i)(I); source-lines: 33-33; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration married_child_excluded content boolean
  depends on married_at_year_end content boolean
  equals married_at_year_end
```

                (II) is not a dependent of such individual by reason of section 152(b)(2) or


<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section2:b0014; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section2(b)(1)(A)(i)(II); source-lines: 35-35; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration child_dependency_exception_excluded content boolean
  depends on excluded_by_section_152_b_2 content boolean
  equals excluded_by_section_152_b_2
```

            (ii) any other person who is a dependent of the taxpayer, if the taxpayer is entitled to a deduction for the taxable year for such person under section 151, or


<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section2:b0015; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section2(b)(1)(A)(ii); source-lines: 37-37; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration other_dependent_household_member content boolean
  depends on is_dependent content boolean,
             deduction_allowed content boolean,
             shares_household content boolean
  equals is_dependent and deduction_allowed and shares_household
```

        (B) maintains a household which constitutes for such taxable year the principal place of abode of the father or mother of the taxpayer, if the taxpayer is entitled to a deduction for the taxable year for such father or mother under section 151.


<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section2:b0016; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section2(b)(1)(B); source-lines: 39-39; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration parent_household_qualifier content boolean
  depends on world content W.World,
             taxpayer content W.Entity,
             parent content W.Entity,
             period content W.TaxPeriod
  equals S152.child_or_descendant of world, taxpayer, parent, period
         and maintains_household_of of world, taxpayer, parent, period
```

    For purposes of this paragraph, an individual shall be considered as maintaining a household only if over half of the cost of maintaining the household during the taxable year is furnished by such individual.


```catala
declaration household_maintenance_test content boolean
  depends on furnished_by_taxpayer content money,
             total_household_cost content money
  equals furnished_by_taxpayer > 50% * total_household_cost
```

    (2) Determination of status

    Notwithstanding paragraph (1),


```catala
declaration subsection_b_status_after_special_rules content boolean
  depends on paragraph_one_status content boolean,
             special_rule_status content boolean
  equals paragraph_one_status or special_rule_status
```

        (A) an individual who is legally separated from his spouse under a decree of divorce or of separate maintenance shall not be considered as married;


<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section2:b0019; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section2(b)(2)(A); source-lines: 47-47; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration separated_individual_not_married content boolean
  depends on world content W.World,
             taxpayer content W.Entity,
             period content W.TaxPeriod
  equals exists separation among
           (W.relationship_events_of_kind of world, W.EventKind.LegalSeparation)
         such that W.has_agent of separation, taxpayer
                   and W.overlaps_period of separation.starts,
                                                separation.ends, period
```

        (B) a taxpayer shall be considered as not married at the close of his taxable year if at any time during the taxable year his spouse is a nonresident alien; and


<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section2:b0020; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section2(b)(2)(B); source-lines: 49-49; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration spouse_nonresident_treated_not_married content boolean
  depends on world content W.World,
             spouses content list of W.Entity,
             period content W.TaxPeriod
  equals exists spouse among spouses such that
    nonresident_alien_during_year of world, spouse, period
```

        (C) a taxpayer shall be considered as married at the close of his taxable year if his spouse (other than a spouse described in subparagraph (B)) died during the taxable year.


<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section2:b0021; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section2(b)(2)(C); source-lines: 51-51; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration spouse_death_preserves_married_status content boolean
  depends on world content W.World,
             spouses content list of W.Entity,
             period content W.TaxPeriod
  equals exists spouse among spouses such that
    exists death among (W.relationship_events_of_kind of world, W.EventKind.Death)
    such that W.has_agent of death, spouse
              and W.overlaps_period of death.starts, death.ends, period
```

    (3) Limitations

    Notwithstanding paragraph (1), for purposes of this subtitle a taxpayer shall not be considered to be a head of a household-


```catala
declaration head_of_household_limitations_clear content boolean
  depends on world content W.World,
             taxpayer content W.Entity,
             period content W.TaxPeriod,
             qualifying_only_under_152_d_2_h content boolean
  equals not (nonresident_alien_during_year of world, taxpayer, period)
         and not qualifying_only_under_152_d_2_h
```

        (A) if at any time during the taxable year he is a nonresident alien; or


<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section2:b0023; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section2(b)(3)(A); source-lines: 57-57; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration nonresident_alien_during_year content boolean
  depends on world content W.World,
             person content W.Entity,
             period content W.TaxPeriod
  equals exists alien among
           (W.status_events_of_kind of world, W.EventKind.NonresidentAlien)
         such that W.has_agent of alien, person
           and W.overlaps_period of alien.starts, alien.ends, period
```

        (B) by reason of an individual who would not be a dependent for the taxable year but for subparagraph (H) of section 152(d)(2).

<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section2:b0024; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section2(b)(3)(B); source-lines: 59-59; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
scope FilingStatusFor:
  definition marital.world equals world
  definition marital.taxpayer equals taxpayer
  definition marital.period equals period
  definition surviving_scope.world equals world
  definition surviving_scope.taxpayer equals taxpayer
  definition surviving_scope.period equals period
  definition head_scope.world equals world
  definition head_scope.taxpayer equals taxpayer
  definition head_scope.period equals period
  definition spouse equals
    let joint_spouses equals
      list of candidate among marital.result.spouses such that
        W.has_full_year_joint_return of world, taxpayer, candidate, period in
    if joint_spouses != []
    then List.first_element of joint_spouses
    else List.first_element of marital.result.spouses

scope FilingStatusFor:
  definition status equals
    let joint equals
      match spouse with pattern
      -- Absent: false
      -- Present content other:
         W.has_full_year_joint_return of world, taxpayer, other, period in
    if joint or surviving_scope.holds then FilingStatus.JointOrSurviving
    else if head_scope.holds then FilingStatus.HeadOfHousehold
    else if marital.result.married then FilingStatus.MarriedFilingSeparately
    else FilingStatus.Unmarried
```
